,"label":{"name":"device specific issue","color":"fbca04"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/299224453","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2607#issuecomment-299224453","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2607","id":299224453,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5OTIyNDQ1Mw==","user":{"login":"nokite","id":2574061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NzQwNjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2574061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite","html_url":"https://github.com/nokite","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-05-04T15:41:20Z","updated_at":"2017-05-04T15:41:20Z","body":"It's a bit of a pain setting KEY_MAX_INPUT_SIZE to 0, because those classes make extensive use of private/protected/final modifiers etc... So a few classes need to be copied/extended. The solution works for me (I had an issue with Galaxy Nexus and HLS/Dash). \r\nI found a couple of threads where low-end or old devices had trouble with ExoPlayer, and they point to KEY_MAX_INPUT_SIZE=0 as a fix.\r\n\r\nIs this not a recognized issue that needs to be fixed in the main repository? I'm surprised that it doesn't get much attention, apparently. ","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/299224453/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nokite","id":2574061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NzQwNjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2574061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite","html_url":"https://github.com/nokite","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/299296427","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2607#issuecomment-299296427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2607","id":299296427,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5OTI5NjQyNw==","user":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-05-04T20:15:04Z","updated_at":"2017-05-04T20:15:04Z","body":"We should fix the issue for Galaxy Nexus specifically, as reported here. I'm not aware of other devices that see this kind of native crash. If you're aware of specific devices, please let us know.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/299296427/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/299406150","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2607#issuecomment-299406150","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2607","id":299406150,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5OTQwNjE1MA==","user":{"login":"nokite","id":2574061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NzQwNjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2574061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite","html_url":"https://github.com/nokite","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-05-05T08:05:31Z","updated_at":"2017-05-05T08:05:31Z","body":"Apart from Galaxy Nexus I haven't seen another device personally (however, I have tested only 5 devices so far, and I don't want to let my users test it and wait for crash reports...).\r\n\r\nFound on the internet:\r\n\"certain Samsung devices running Jellybean (4.1.2)\"\r\n\"MediaCodec bug on Android 4.1\"\r\nPossibly \"Samsung Galaxy S4\"\r\n\"Samsung Tab 2\"\r\n\"media codec for an .mp4 file on jelly-bean\"\r\n\r\nYou can also see it set to 0 in this project https://github.com/begeekmyfriend/yasea (with someone suggesting that it's probably in order to \"fix MediaCodec bug on Android 4.1\"). \r\n\r\nI tried to pin down the reason, but wasn't able to. A possible clue is that all of the mentioned devices have PowerVR GPU's (SGX540, SGX544MP3).\r\n\r\nReferences:\r\nhttps://github.com/begeekmyfriend/yasea/issues/167\r\nhttp://stackoverflow.com/questions/21284874/illegal-state-exception-when-calling-mediacodec-configure\r\nhttp://stackoverflow.com/questions/15105843/mediacodec-jelly-bean#_=_","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/299406150/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"nokite","id":2574061,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1NzQwNjE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2574061?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite","html_url":"https://github.com/nokite","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nokite/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":1070384947,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDEwNzAzODQ5NDc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/1070384947","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2017-05-05T11:03:33Z","label":{"name":"bug","color":"fc2929"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":1070677057,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDEwNzA2NzcwNTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/1070677057","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"referenced","commit_id":"7f66725953da42e78997838556a6ad1cdb95a046","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/commits/7f66725953da42e78997838556a6ad1cdb95a046","created_at":"2017-05-05T14:37:36Z","performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/299482339","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2607#issuecomment-299482339","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/2607","id":299482339,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI5OTQ4MjMzOQ==","user":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-05-05T14:37:56Z","updated_at":"2017-05-05T14:37:56Z","body":"I think the issue is less that we're setting KEY_MAX_INPUT_SIZE at all, and more that we're just setting the value to be unnecessarily high. Codecs on these API levels are not adaptive (i.e. cannot handle seamless resolution switching). Hence ExoPlayer releases the codec and instantiates a new instance when a resolution switch occurs, which is why resolution switching isn't completely seamless on older devices.\r\n\r\nHowever in V2 it appears we're setting KEY_MAX_INPUT_SIZE on the basis that the decoder might be adaptive. Importantly, this means we'll use the max input size for the highest resolution stream when configuring the codec for one of the lower resolutions. The codec may choose to instantiate more input buffers at lower resolutions than at higher ones, and hence when configuring for a lower resolution the issue may cause more memory to be allocated than would actually be needed to configure at the higher resolution.\r\n\r\nI've pushed a change that tweaks our logic to correctly take into account whether the decoder is adaptive. Please give it a try on the `dev-v2` branch. It fixed the issue for me on Galaxy Nexus.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/299482339/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"ojw28","id":7881572,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE1NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7881572?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28","html_url":"https://github.com/ojw28","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ojw28/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users